id: copy-index
name: Copy Index
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Quick Learner
description: >
  You are able to quickly learn multiple techniques at once, and use the techniques copied from one opponent on another.
text: >
  Copy Index: You are able to quickly learn multiple techniques at once, and use the techniques copied from one opponent on another.
  –Prerequisites: Quick Learner
  (1)-[Passive]: You can possess 2 Copied Techniques at any one time.
  (2)-[Triggered]: At the end of each Combat Encounter, you may select one Copied Technique to retain access to until the end of your next Combat Encounter.

---

[passive]
# (1) Two Copied Techniques held: a third copied, which to lose asked (chat.mjs copyTechnique).
copied.max += 1;
# (2) As the Encounter ends, beside Quick Learner (4)'s question: one of them kept, still Copied, till the next one ends
# (combat.mjs).
allow copyIndex.retain;
